{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00039",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 2.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Hello, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.61,
      "end_seconds": 7.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.37,
      "end_seconds": 12.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.39,
      "end_seconds": 19.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Alright, of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Did the receptionist sort you out quickly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.79,
      "end_seconds": 22.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Yes, she was lovely about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.62,
      "end_seconds": 27.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "What was the main thing you wanted to talk about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 27.63,
      "end_seconds": 31.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Doctor, it's hot flushes. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.41,
      "end_seconds": 34.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.56,
      "end_seconds": 37.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "About... well, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.39,
      "end_seconds": 46.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.09,
      "end_seconds": 53.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. It happens all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.83,
      "end_seconds": 56.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Have you had night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.14,
      "end_seconds": 58.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Yes, since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.2,
      "end_seconds": 61.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.58,
      "end_seconds": 75.08,
      "duration_seconds": 10.5,
      "text": "It happens a couple of times a week. There's vaginal dryness as well. With vaginal dryness, a six out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.63,
      "end_seconds": 77.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.73,
      "end_seconds": 81.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 82.58,
      "end_seconds": 87.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice palpitations. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.45,
      "end_seconds": 93.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.83,
      "end_seconds": 102.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any heavy bleeding, chest pain or breast lumps at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.6,
      "end_seconds": 105.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.03,
      "end_seconds": 111.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss or bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.21,
      "end_seconds": 116.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss or bleeding after sex, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.32,
      "end_seconds": 122.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.49,
      "end_seconds": 125.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.69,
      "end_seconds": 129.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.85,
      "end_seconds": 132.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "I have thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.44,
      "end_seconds": 134.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.06,
      "end_seconds": 138.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.53,
      "end_seconds": 143.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.94,
      "end_seconds": 154.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "I'm allergic to eggs, I get a rash. Yes, sulfa drugs, it gives me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.79,
      "end_seconds": 159.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.72,
      "end_seconds": 168.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.98,
      "end_seconds": 170.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.67,
      "end_seconds": 175.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.78,
      "end_seconds": 181.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Alright, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.88,
      "end_seconds": 185.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Um, my mother had high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.9,
      "end_seconds": 188.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.86,
      "end_seconds": 195.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "It's alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week. I'm, I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 196.99,
      "end_seconds": 204.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the losartan was 25 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.58,
      "end_seconds": 207.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.49,
      "end_seconds": 211.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.11,
      "end_seconds": 214.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.11,
      "end_seconds": 219.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Just my tonsils out, when I was a child."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.52,
      "end_seconds": 222.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "So, I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.2,
      "end_seconds": 235.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.14,
      "end_seconds": 263.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 78, blood pressure 118 over 68. And SpO2 98 percent on room air, temp 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.42,
      "end_seconds": 267.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.64,
      "end_seconds": 271.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.97,
      "end_seconds": 276.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.92,
      "end_seconds": 278.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.96,
      "end_seconds": 301.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Blood pressure and pulse are fine, and there are no breast lumps on examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.73,
      "end_seconds": 329.83,
      "duration_seconds": 25.1,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with perimenopausal symptoms at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. It could also be a thyroid problem, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.13,
      "end_seconds": 331.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.32,
      "end_seconds": 349.66,
      "duration_seconds": 16.34,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's perimenopausal symptoms, and we'll know more once the a bone density scan is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had hot flushes for about a month, and no heavy bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.56,
      "end_seconds": 353.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Yes, you know, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.93,
      "end_seconds": 377.45,
      "duration_seconds": 21.52,
      "text": "Let's get a bone density scan, for menopause. Let's get blood tests, for irregular periods. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Layers of clothing, a fan by the bed, and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.27,
      "end_seconds": 391.55,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.93,
      "end_seconds": 393.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.21,
      "end_seconds": 403.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.91,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Please come and see me in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.82,
      "end_seconds": 406.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 407.38,
      "end_seconds": 411.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Okay, I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 412.39,
      "end_seconds": 413.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}